  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. In a large bowl, whisk together smoked paprika, garlic powder, salt, and black pepper.",
    "3. Add beef strips to the bowl and toss to coat with spice mixture.",
    "4. Thread beef, cherry tomatoes, and red onion onto skewers.",
    "5. Brush olive oil onto the skewers and season with salt and pepper.",
    "6. Grill skewers for 10-12 minutes, turning occasionally, until beef is cooked to desired level of doneness.",
    "7. Brush skewers with lime juice during the last minute of cooking.",
    "8. Garnish with fresh cilantro and serve immediately."
